governor turn 1: plan -> watchlist-store, watchlist  (The two things that make the watchlist hard to use today are that it can only be read as one flat list (no way to see what is still unwatched or find a title) and that removing an item is irreversible. I will make it easier to scan (filter tabs + sort options surfaced through a new computed visibleMovies) and safer to edit (undo for remove, backed by a new persisted WatchlistStore.restore). All changes are additive; existing behaviour and tests stay intact.)
